      ],
      "When Is This Method Used?": "Reach for a Design Sprint when you have one big, risky question and need a real answer fast, before pouring months into building. It shines when a team is unsure which direction to take and wants to test an idea with actual users in days rather than quarters. It is also a quick way to get a group aligned, since everyone works through the problem together in the same room.",
      "Resource to Learn More": "https://www.gv.com/sprint/",
