      "When Is This Method Used?": "SAFe comes into play when the work is simply too big for one team, and many teams across an organization need to pull in the same direction. It helps when coordination, alignment, and planning at scale are the real challenge, and when leaders need everyone responding to change together rather than drifting apart. It is built for large, complex efforts, not small ones.",
